# Leave this EMPTY when running in GitHub Codespaces (or any setup where the
# browser and the backend aren't on the same "localhost"). The frontend's own
# dev server proxies /api, /health and /realtime to the backend internally
# (see frontend/vite.config.ts), so relative requests always reach it —
# but "http://localhost:4000" resolves to the machine running the BROWSER,
# not the Codespace, and that's what causes the "Backend Unreachable" status
# in the footer. Only set this to an absolute URL for a non-proxied setup
# (e.g. a separately deployed backend in production).
VITE_API_BASE_URL=